      "created_at": "2014-06-11T16:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can only search your deck for the card. If there are none,, you are out of luck. however, the rest of the card doesn't fizzle, since it doesn't say \"If you do..\" Therefore, you could still draw a card, and play a card. of corse, the card you play could be the Signature card in your hand.</p>",
